{"version":1,"content":"<p>「薔琵」逐漸遠離台灣，預計將於周一（26日）前後接近日本九州地區，並減弱為溫帶氣旋。</p><p>日本氣象廳要求九州北部、西日本至東日本的廣大地區警惕地質災害、低窪地區積水與河流水位上漲。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T07:58:04.300917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T05:44:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:06.867765+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:51:13.798150+00:00","content_hash":"e647e587a69792afe59f5447f732b4fe8620997e685a0738d1348c60ffd75a14","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}